  "input": {
    "structured_en": "[Span arrangement] Single simply supported span of 30 m (centre-to-centre of bearings); deck width 10 m.\n[Section and material] Precast prestressed small box girders, 3 per span; middle-girder section at midspan: depth 1.6 m; top width 2.40 m; flange 0.18 m thick at the tip, thickening by 6.3 cm over a 19.2 cm long haunch next to the web; bottom slab 1.00 m wide and 0.18 m thick; top slab 0.18 m thick; webs 0.20 m thick (measured horizontally) with outer faces inclined at 1:4; 15 cm x 7 cm chamfers at the upper corners of the cell; girder concrete C55. Consider the self-weight of the main girders only (no wet joints, diaphragms, pavement or barriers).\n[Bearings and boundary] Abutments at both ends. Abutment 0 and Abutment 1: plain laminated elastomeric bearings, two under each girder end; effective plan size 300 mm x 400 mm, five internal rubber layers 8 mm thick.\n[Design standard] Highway Class I loading (JTG D60-2015); two-way traffic, carriageway width 9 m, two design lanes.",
    "structured_zh": "【跨径布置】单跨简支，计算跨径 30 m（支座中心线间距）；桥面全宽 10 m。\n【截面与材料】预制预应力混凝土小箱梁，每跨 3 片；中梁跨中截面：梁高 1.6 m；顶宽 2.40 m；翼缘端部厚 0.18 m，近腹板处经 19.2 cm 长加腋增厚 6.3 cm；底板宽 1.00 m、厚 0.18 m；顶板厚 0.18 m；腹板水平厚 0.20 m，外侧坡度 1:4；箱内顶角设 15 cm × 7 cm 倒角；主梁混凝土 C55。只计主梁自重（不计湿接缝、横隔板、铺装与护栏）。\n【支座与边界】两端为桥台。0 号台、1 号台：普通板式橡胶支座，每个梁端 2 个；有效平面尺寸 300 mm × 400 mm，中间橡胶层 5 层、每层厚 8 mm。\n【设计标准】公路-I 级（JTG D60-2015）；双向行驶，行车道宽 9 m，设计车道数 2。"
  },
